# The repository root is the build context of the Python images only
# (infra/docker/python-service.Dockerfile). Send just what they need, and never .env.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!apps/agent-service/
!mcp-servers/
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/tests
# The TypeScript MCP server has its own image (and a big node_modules).
mcp-servers/k8s-readonly
**/node_modules
